# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep the Android/TWA build out of the DEPLOYED site.
#
# Bubblewrap generates its Android project INTO this folder — the same folder
# Vercel deploys as a static site. Without this file the very next deploy would
# publish `android.keystore` at a public URL, and anyone who downloaded it could
# sign an update that Android would accept as a genuine update to this app.
# That key cannot be rotated for already-installed users.
#
# 🚫 NEVER add `.well-known/` here. `.well-known/assetlinks.json` MUST stay
# public — it is how Android verifies the app owns this domain, and if it 404s
# the TWA shows a browser address bar across the top of the game.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Signing keys — the critical one.
*.keystore
*.jks

# Bubblewrap / Gradle project output
app/
.gradle/
gradle/
gradlew
gradlew.bat
*.gradle
gradle.properties
local.properties
*.apk
*.aab
twa-manifest.json
store_icon.png
manifest-checksum.txt
